1
00:00:56,393 --> 00:01:02,692
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:07,115 --> 00:01:09,448
You have never stayed overnight at my residence.

3
00:01:09,604 --> 00:01:12,018
You sound like you know me pretty well.

4
00:01:13,377 --> 00:01:15,632
You're always suspicious of me and Shen Xiao.

5
00:01:16,157 --> 00:01:17,440
Do you want me to get caught

6
00:01:17,538 --> 00:01:20,120
so you can make room for your new mistress?

7
00:01:22,115 --> 00:01:23,352
Li Shu.

8
00:01:23,693 --> 00:01:26,041
If I didn't know you hated me,

9
00:01:26,483 --> 00:01:28,174
I would've thought

10
00:01:28,435 --> 00:01:30,436
that you were just jealous.

11
00:01:35,716 --> 00:01:36,953
Let go of me!

12
00:01:37,854 --> 00:01:39,975
How did it come to this between us?

13
00:01:40,056 --> 00:01:41,136
Let go!

14
00:01:41,436 --> 00:01:42,673
Let go of me!

15
00:01:43,107 --> 00:01:44,298
Let go of me!

16
00:01:46,660 --> 00:01:47,897
Let go of me!

17
00:02:12,387 --> 00:02:14,240
That was in the past. Why keep bringing it up?

18
00:02:20,308 --> 00:02:22,121
I'm not the one who saved Shen Xiao.

19
00:02:22,843 --> 00:02:24,138
You're blaming the wrong person.

20
00:02:30,915 --> 00:02:32,053
I'm tired.

21
00:02:32,475 --> 00:02:33,626
Just go.

22
00:02:59,164 --> 00:03:00,497
Get some rest.

23
00:03:17,021 --> 00:03:19,301
He insulted you on your wedding night.

24
00:03:20,211 --> 00:03:21,666
He even kept a mistress.

25
00:03:23,060 --> 00:03:24,674
What's so shocking about that?

26
00:03:25,515 --> 00:03:27,370
Isn't every man like this?

27
00:03:30,118 --> 00:03:31,758
Does that make it okay?

28
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:34,160
Even if it's not okay, does that mean it'll never happen?

29
00:03:37,356 --> 00:03:39,410
Do you still care about the Prince Consort?

30
00:03:44,316 --> 00:03:45,503
No.

31
00:03:45,698 --> 00:03:48,624
Since you are done and divorced, why are you still involved with him?

32
00:03:49,475 --> 00:03:51,013
Who do you think you are?

33
00:03:51,516 --> 00:03:52,806
You are just a male companion.

34
00:03:52,976 --> 00:03:55,149
You think you have any say in my life?

35
00:03:58,772 --> 00:04:01,187
What if I don't want to be just your male companion?

36
00:04:10,053 --> 00:04:11,570
Are you crazy?

37
00:04:12,350 --> 00:04:13,950
Did you not hear what I said?

38
00:04:14,072 --> 00:04:16,192
Just do your job and stay out of trouble!

39
00:04:16,348 --> 00:04:18,601
Like I don't have enough trouble already?

40
00:04:24,595 --> 00:04:25,832
I get it.

41
00:04:27,444 --> 00:04:29,898
You and the Prince Consort aren't like normal couples.

42
00:04:31,283 --> 00:04:32,898
Only when the Crown Prince falls,

43
00:04:33,636 --> 00:04:35,730
will you finally be free.

44
00:04:39,772 --> 00:04:41,226
Whatever I need to do,

45
00:04:42,276 --> 00:04:43,851
I'll do it all.

46
00:05:17,555 --> 00:05:19,160
That Shen scoundrel...

47
00:05:19,435 --> 00:05:22,174
No. Censor Shen really is something else.

48
00:05:22,276 --> 00:05:23,355
I thought

49
00:05:23,446 --> 00:05:25,914
it was Censor Shen who stole your heart.

50
00:05:26,099 --> 00:05:27,379
But now, it looks like

51
00:05:27,498 --> 00:05:29,953
it's you who gave your heart away.

52
00:05:30,499 --> 00:05:31,833
What nonsense are you spouting?

53
00:05:35,595 --> 00:05:37,671
Your Highness, are you having a headache again?

54
00:05:37,781 --> 00:05:40,736
Without Censor Shen here tonight, are you going to have nightmares again?

55
00:05:40,907 --> 00:05:42,958
How about I call Censor Shen back for you?

56
00:05:43,057 --> 00:05:44,537
He works better than any medicine.

57
00:05:44,618 --> 00:05:46,032
What Censor Shen?

58
00:05:46,693 --> 00:05:47,930
He's just Shen the scoundrel.

59
00:05:48,037 --> 00:05:49,957
A meddling fool who can't mind his own business!

60
00:05:57,333 --> 00:06:01,173
Seventh Prince Qin has traveled across the realm,

61
00:06:01,264 --> 00:06:02,984
bringing treasures as tribute.

62
00:06:03,075 --> 00:06:04,714
His Majesty is pleased,

63
00:06:04,805 --> 00:06:08,579
thus inviting officials and royal kin to join the celebration

64
00:06:08,892 --> 00:06:11,265
to share His Majesty's grace.

65
00:06:18,780 --> 00:06:21,620
I have returned from my journey and prepared three gifts

66
00:06:21,938 --> 00:06:23,592
to present to you, Father.

67
00:06:26,931 --> 00:06:28,345
This is the first gift.

68
00:06:28,907 --> 00:06:30,640
The finest rice harvested this year

69
00:06:30,797 --> 00:06:33,357
from Wanming Granary in Jiangnan.

70
00:06:33,461 --> 00:06:34,795
Every grain is as pure as jade.

71
00:06:35,755 --> 00:06:37,355
Guanzhong suffered a drought earlier.

72
00:06:37,559 --> 00:06:39,607
I was concerned when I heard about it.

73
00:06:40,035 --> 00:06:41,687
So I brought this rice as tribute.

74
00:06:41,857 --> 00:06:44,602
May our Ye Dynasty enjoy a bountiful harvest.

75
00:06:45,491 --> 00:06:46,986
The drought in Guanzhong.

76
00:06:47,551 --> 00:06:49,325
This rice is truly a good omen.

77
00:06:49,894 --> 00:06:51,131
Excellent.

78
00:06:51,487 --> 00:06:53,534
Father, this is the second gift.

79
00:06:53,860 --> 00:06:55,379
I passed through Longxi

80
00:06:55,499 --> 00:06:57,114
and found an ancient, nameless stele,

81
00:06:57,555 --> 00:06:59,420
engraved with a folk song passed down for centuries,

82
00:06:59,444 --> 00:07:00,819
praising the love of parents,

83
00:07:01,068 --> 00:07:02,708
and wishing peace for home and the state.

84
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:04,258
I made a rubbing and present it to you.

85
00:07:04,282 --> 00:07:05,519
May Father

86
00:07:06,086 --> 00:07:08,019
enjoy a prosperous and long life in good health.

87
00:07:09,029 --> 00:07:10,602
This gift is simple and sincere.

88
00:07:11,821 --> 00:07:13,235
My son is truly thoughtful.

89
00:07:15,092 --> 00:07:17,066
Father, please look at the last gift.

90
00:07:22,195 --> 00:07:23,517
This last gift

91
00:07:23,679 --> 00:07:25,533
is the Ye Dynasty Illustrated Almanac.

92
00:07:26,147 --> 00:07:28,913
After leaving the palace, I traveled throughout Ye.

93
00:07:29,052 --> 00:07:31,092
I documented every mountain, river, and city I saw,

94
00:07:31,252 --> 00:07:34,154
along with the customs and local products in this almanac.

95
00:07:35,731 --> 00:07:37,390
Although the almanac is complete,

96
00:07:38,092 --> 00:07:39,772
it still needs some refining.

97
00:07:39,863 --> 00:07:41,640
Please allow me

98
00:07:41,867 --> 00:07:44,696
to stay at Qianfo Temple to focus on completing the illustrations.

99
00:07:45,108 --> 00:07:47,310
So I can soon present it to you, Father.

100
00:07:48,532 --> 00:07:49,769
Very good.

101
00:07:50,164 --> 00:07:53,329
Such magnificent landscapes are all captured by my son.

102
00:07:54,204 --> 00:07:55,441
Issue the decree.

103
00:07:55,647 --> 00:07:57,238
Bestow upon Seventh Prince Li Qin

104
00:07:57,319 --> 00:07:59,133
ten bars of tribute ink from the West

105
00:07:59,244 --> 00:08:00,429
and 100 bolts of tribute silk.

106
00:08:00,453 --> 00:08:02,253
He is permitted to walk before the throne.

107
00:08:02,382 --> 00:08:04,369
You can stay at the Tranquil Room at Qianfo Temple

108
00:08:04,393 --> 00:08:06,011
to focus on finishing the almanac.

109
00:08:06,291 --> 00:08:07,545
All expenses

110
00:08:07,724 --> 00:08:09,658
will be covered by the inner court.

111
00:08:11,892 --> 00:08:13,506
Thank you for your grace, Father.

112
00:08:23,261 --> 00:08:25,363
Seventh Brother vanished for ten years without a word.

113
00:08:25,387 --> 00:08:26,721
Now, you've suddenly returned,

114
00:08:27,294 --> 00:08:28,871
making everyone see you in a whole new light.

115
00:08:28,895 --> 00:08:30,229
Thank you for the compliment.

116
00:08:30,917 --> 00:08:33,697
I am of little use to the nation.

117
00:08:34,092 --> 00:08:36,946
I can only do small and insignificant things.

118
00:08:37,963 --> 00:08:39,200
Alright.

119
00:08:39,309 --> 00:08:41,283
Then finish the almanac well.

120
00:08:41,667 --> 00:08:43,320
Don't let Father down.

121
00:08:45,812 --> 00:08:47,049
Yes, Brother.

122
00:08:56,355 --> 00:08:58,049
Compared to mine,

123
00:08:58,339 --> 00:09:01,770
the landscapes you painted have an even grander aura.

124
00:09:01,917 --> 00:09:04,411
Three gifts brought you back before the throne.

125
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:06,039
So these ten years have been worth it.

126
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:08,964
For now, just focus on your cultivation at Qianfo Temple.

127
00:09:09,122 --> 00:09:11,042
Wait until Shen Xiao pits the Crown Prince

128
00:09:11,193 --> 00:09:13,214
against the Second Prince and both are weakened,

129
00:09:13,295 --> 00:09:15,374
then you'll return to court.

130
00:09:15,603 --> 00:09:18,432
I have no doubts about your plan.

131
00:09:19,891 --> 00:09:21,128
It's just that

132
00:09:21,268 --> 00:09:24,771
don't you intend to share our plan with Shen Xiao?

133
00:09:27,371 --> 00:09:29,051
I recommended him to you back then.

134
00:09:29,137 --> 00:09:31,571
But now, we've put him in danger by himself.

135
00:09:31,871 --> 00:09:33,072
I feel uneasy about it.

136
00:09:33,172 --> 00:09:35,160
We see each other as close friends.

137
00:09:35,644 --> 00:09:37,018
But we've kept this a secret

138
00:09:37,830 --> 00:09:39,284
from him all this while.

139
00:09:42,851 --> 00:09:44,506
You recommended him to me.

140
00:09:44,668 --> 00:09:48,354
But you didn't know he did plenty of ruthless things for his career.

141
00:09:48,605 --> 00:09:50,975
He has a calculative mind, and he acts decisively.

142
00:09:51,066 --> 00:09:53,160
If his goals align with ours,

143
00:09:53,771 --> 00:09:55,611
he'll eventually find out about your identity.

144
00:09:55,843 --> 00:09:58,178
What if his goals don't match ours?

145
00:09:59,867 --> 00:10:02,242
You're meant to sit on the throne one day.

146
00:10:02,867 --> 00:10:04,762
You can't let personal feelings hold you back.

147
00:10:05,915 --> 00:10:07,197
But I promise you

148
00:10:07,868 --> 00:10:09,322
that I'll spare his life.

149
00:10:09,868 --> 00:10:11,105
Remember.

150
00:10:11,186 --> 00:10:12,920
No matter who gets hurt along the way,

151
00:10:13,539 --> 00:10:16,192
we can't let anything stop us from reaching our goal.

152
00:10:19,484 --> 00:10:20,817
I understand.

153
00:10:26,652 --> 00:10:29,730
He's the cursed child who killed his own mother during birth.

154
00:10:30,035 --> 00:10:32,235
Father has always seen him as a jinx.

155
00:10:32,971 --> 00:10:35,185
He's never attended the court for a single day.

156
00:10:35,708 --> 00:10:36,854
I just don't believe

157
00:10:38,145 --> 00:10:41,472
that he can turn the tables with just these three worthless gifts.

158
00:10:41,876 --> 00:10:43,113
Could it be

159
00:10:44,451 --> 00:10:46,545
that he's here to fight me for the throne

160
00:10:46,659 --> 00:10:48,617
like Second Brother?

161
00:10:49,156 --> 00:10:50,393
Ridiculous.

162
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,643
It's too much of a coincidence for Seventh Prince

163
00:10:52,667 --> 00:10:54,238
to return to the capital now,

164
00:10:54,351 --> 00:10:56,525
He showed up just as Shen Xiao appeared.

165
00:10:56,947 --> 00:10:58,835
It's definitely not a coincidence, Your Highness.

166
00:10:58,859 --> 00:11:00,673
Does he have connections with Shen Xiao?

167
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:02,697
Or has he come back

168
00:11:03,925 --> 00:11:06,098
to help Second Brother?

169
00:11:07,786 --> 00:11:11,062
Now Shen Xiao and Second Prince are clearly looking for your wrongdoings.

170
00:11:11,417 --> 00:11:12,988
Luckily, we're prepared.

171
00:11:13,139 --> 00:11:14,554
As for Seventh Prince,

172
00:11:14,932 --> 00:11:16,626
he has no foundation at court yet.

173
00:11:16,717 --> 00:11:17,917
He's not a threat for now,

174
00:11:18,163 --> 00:11:20,003
but we should still remind the elders at court

175
00:11:20,236 --> 00:11:21,889
so they don't get any ideas about him.

176
00:11:23,429 --> 00:11:25,920
It's time these people get a wake-up call.

177
00:11:26,828 --> 00:11:28,988
My birthday banquet in three days

178
00:11:29,131 --> 00:11:30,626
will be the perfect opportunity.

179
00:11:36,955 --> 00:11:38,795
I've invited all of you here today

180
00:11:38,876 --> 00:11:40,357
not just for my birthday celebration.

181
00:11:40,448 --> 00:11:42,162
It's because the nation is facing a disaster now.

182
00:11:42,186 --> 00:11:43,910
The Eastern Palace will set up a relief granary

183
00:11:43,934 --> 00:11:45,156
to support the nation when needed.

184
00:11:45,180 --> 00:11:46,220
To set an example,

185
00:11:46,311 --> 00:11:48,751
the Eastern Palace will donate 100,000 piculs of grain first.

186
00:11:49,322 --> 00:11:51,056
I hope everyone will join in.

187
00:11:54,476 --> 00:11:55,713
This...

188
00:11:57,502 --> 00:11:59,612
(What's all this about preparing for national crisis?)

189
00:11:59,636 --> 00:12:02,320
(The Crown Prince is taking advantage of Le Sheng's return)

190
00:12:02,487 --> 00:12:06,169
(to invite all the neutral officials here using this birthday banquet.)

191
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:08,576
(He just wants to tie the noble families down)

192
00:12:08,708 --> 00:12:10,883
(and show off to Father.)

193
00:12:13,004 --> 00:12:15,004
The Zheng family is willing to support your cause.

194
00:12:20,411 --> 00:12:22,666
You have my support too.

195
00:12:31,853 --> 00:12:33,331
You have the Sang family's support.

196
00:12:33,459 --> 00:12:35,112
You have the Ding family's support too.

197
00:12:36,251 --> 00:12:37,865
You have the Bai family's support too.

198
00:12:38,366 --> 00:12:39,483
You have my support.

199
00:12:39,574 --> 00:12:43,868
- You have my support too. - I'll support you.

200
00:12:46,579 --> 00:12:48,495
May I ask, will the grains for the relief granary

201
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:50,399
be managed by the Ministry of Revenue

202
00:12:50,514 --> 00:12:53,194
or should we follow the Eastern Palace's command?

203
00:12:55,955 --> 00:12:57,146
Second Brother,

204
00:12:59,052 --> 00:13:01,065
are you questioning my loyalty?

205
00:13:17,103 --> 00:13:19,794
Your Highness's devotion to the nation and its people is evident.

206
00:13:19,891 --> 00:13:21,185
I, Shen Xiao,

207
00:13:21,740 --> 00:13:25,232
have specially come here to wish the Crown Princess prosperity and health.

208
00:13:25,731 --> 00:13:28,331
I heard the Crown Princess is donating grains to build a granary.

209
00:13:28,376 --> 00:13:31,140
I admire your benevolence for the people.

210
00:13:31,245 --> 00:13:33,778
So, I've specially brought you a birthday gift.

211
00:13:46,924 --> 00:13:48,952
- What's that smell? - It's a rice sack.

212
00:13:52,989 --> 00:13:54,389
This is clearly dirt.

213
00:13:54,517 --> 00:13:55,837
How dare you insult me?

214
00:13:55,928 --> 00:13:58,499
It's not an insult. This is the reality among the people.

215
00:13:58,590 --> 00:14:00,843
The grains people buy from officials now

216
00:14:01,251 --> 00:14:04,875
are mixed with dirt and husks.

217
00:14:05,309 --> 00:14:07,443
Doesn't this show you

218
00:14:07,732 --> 00:14:09,826
the urgency of building a relief granary?

219
00:14:11,220 --> 00:14:12,713
You arrogant brat.

220
00:14:13,396 --> 00:14:15,161
- Seize him! - My fellow officials.

221
00:14:15,444 --> 00:14:19,090
Have you heard the cries of the people outside?

222
00:14:31,643 --> 00:14:32,971
Your Highness!

223
00:14:33,052 --> 00:14:35,692
Bad news. The refugees have blocked the gates upon hearing

224
00:14:35,805 --> 00:14:38,445
the Crown Princess is giving out porridge at her birthday banquet.

225
00:14:39,843 --> 00:14:41,198
This is rebellion!

226
00:14:41,700 --> 00:14:42,937
This is rebellion!

227
00:14:47,152 --> 00:14:48,472
We can't investigate any further.

228
00:14:48,523 --> 00:14:51,203
The Crown Prince has stalled the Yongtong Canal's construction.

229
00:14:51,295 --> 00:14:53,243
He's trying to bring down the Ministry of Revenue.

230
00:14:53,267 --> 00:14:55,387
To build the canal, we need to distribute the grains.

231
00:14:55,891 --> 00:14:58,235
We can't stall any longer.

232
00:14:58,378 --> 00:15:00,720
Grains? Where are we supposed to get grains from?

233
00:15:01,420 --> 00:15:03,180
Can we use the military grains from Taicang?

234
00:15:03,266 --> 00:15:05,880
The royals, noble families, and honored officials

235
00:15:06,245 --> 00:15:08,138
have surplus grains.

236
00:15:08,939 --> 00:15:10,659
The only way is to collect grains from them

237
00:15:10,893 --> 00:15:12,546
to break the Crown Prince's plan.

238
00:15:12,843 --> 00:15:14,323
Then the Yongtong Canal can be built.

239
00:15:14,367 --> 00:15:15,872
And the people can be saved.

240
00:15:15,977 --> 00:15:17,197
Collecting grains?

241
00:15:17,308 --> 00:15:19,637
Taking food from the mouths of nobles and officials

242
00:15:19,806 --> 00:15:21,715
is basically cutting yourself off from the court.

243
00:15:21,739 --> 00:15:23,473
No one would do that.

244
00:15:25,827 --> 00:15:27,064
I'm willing to do that.

245
00:15:27,243 --> 00:15:28,857
But I need an imperial decree.

246
00:15:29,026 --> 00:15:30,681
To get that decree,

247
00:15:30,955 --> 00:15:34,217
I have to borrow some support from the Crown Prince first.

248
00:15:36,348 --> 00:15:37,585
This is rebellion!

249
00:16:38,161 --> 00:16:39,535
Back up!

250
00:16:39,616 --> 00:16:40,840
Move aside!

251
00:16:40,979 --> 00:16:43,370
What are you doing? Are you rebelling?

252
00:16:44,828 --> 00:16:45,959
Back up!

253
00:16:46,596 --> 00:16:49,996
Please, have mercy. My child is starving to death.

254
00:16:50,467 --> 00:16:52,760
Please have some mercy, noble ones.

255
00:16:53,827 --> 00:16:55,880
Please, have mercy.

256
00:16:58,532 --> 00:17:01,252
Noble one, just give me a bowl of porridge.

257
00:17:01,355 --> 00:17:03,289
I'm begging you.

258
00:17:03,956 --> 00:17:05,835
Please help us.

259
00:17:05,934 --> 00:17:07,171
Go away!

260
00:17:31,043 --> 00:17:32,640
Anyone trespassing in the residence

261
00:17:32,884 --> 00:17:34,560
will be treated as a rioter.

262
00:17:39,867 --> 00:17:41,236
They're citizens,

263
00:17:41,539 --> 00:17:42,735
not rioters.

264
00:17:43,380 --> 00:17:45,122
Didn't the Crown Prince set up this banquet of love

265
00:17:45,146 --> 00:17:46,960
to help the people?

266
00:17:49,915 --> 00:17:54,290
That's right. Today's banquet is meant to aid the disaster victims.

267
00:17:54,667 --> 00:17:56,787
Guards, set up the porridge stalls.

268
00:17:56,949 --> 00:18:00,802
Thank you, noble one.

269
00:18:09,556 --> 00:18:11,075
The imperial decree has arrived!

270
00:18:11,156 --> 00:18:13,756
Shen Xiao of the Ministry of Revenue, accept this decree.

271
00:18:13,847 --> 00:18:17,520
I am pleased with the Crown Princess's disaster relief birthday banquet.

272
00:18:17,628 --> 00:18:20,865
I hereby order Shen Xiao, the censor of the Ministry of Revenue,

273
00:18:20,956 --> 00:18:22,889
to collect grains with this decree.

274
00:18:23,036 --> 00:18:24,595
From princes and nobles downward,

275
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:26,520
all those of high rank

276
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:28,481
with 1,000 piculs as salary,

277
00:18:28,589 --> 00:18:30,723
must donate according to their means

278
00:18:30,814 --> 00:18:33,268
to meet the urgent needs of the nation.

279
00:18:33,411 --> 00:18:35,091
We are at a difficult time.

280
00:18:35,187 --> 00:18:36,680
People's lives are at stake.

281
00:18:36,755 --> 00:18:39,826
Helping the nation in hardship shows true loyalty.

282
00:18:40,056 --> 00:18:42,148
May you all understand my kind intentions

283
00:18:42,245 --> 00:18:43,939
and work together for this cause.

284
00:18:44,020 --> 00:18:46,400
Do not betray the court's favor.

285
00:18:46,501 --> 00:18:48,074
So decreed.

286
00:18:48,725 --> 00:18:51,018
I, Shen Xiao, accept the decree.

287
00:19:13,148 --> 00:19:15,082
Shen Xiao is ordered to collect grains.

288
00:19:15,715 --> 00:19:17,010
Have you heard about that?

289
00:19:17,965 --> 00:19:19,419
(I haven't just heard about it.)

290
00:19:20,034 --> 00:19:22,080
(I haven't seen him for half a month.)

291
00:19:22,404 --> 00:19:24,578
(It's kept me up at night lately.)

292
00:19:27,867 --> 00:19:29,482
I have heard a bit about it.

293
00:19:30,083 --> 00:19:31,704
I heard Shen Xiao

294
00:19:31,886 --> 00:19:34,144
has been visiting all the noble families recently.

295
00:19:34,314 --> 00:19:35,848
But with little success.

296
00:19:36,197 --> 00:19:37,651
So far, the grains collected

297
00:19:37,993 --> 00:19:39,447
are less than 50,000 piculs.

298
00:19:40,453 --> 00:19:42,306
Less than 50,000 piculs?

299
00:19:46,764 --> 00:19:48,001
Shen Xiao

300
00:19:48,347 --> 00:19:50,482
is not just collecting grains for Yongtong Canal.

301
00:19:50,676 --> 00:19:52,451
It's also for me.

302
00:19:52,700 --> 00:19:53,954
These people

303
00:19:54,493 --> 00:19:56,306
are humiliating me.

304
00:20:12,285 --> 00:20:13,522
I want you

305
00:20:13,941 --> 00:20:16,155
to lead the grain donation for Shen Xiao.

306
00:20:19,052 --> 00:20:20,666
You're my daughter,

307
00:20:21,292 --> 00:20:23,080
and a member of the Cui family.

308
00:20:23,452 --> 00:20:25,226
You are close to the Eastern Palace.

309
00:20:25,635 --> 00:20:26,970
If you take action,

310
00:20:27,588 --> 00:20:29,441
the noble families and royals

311
00:20:29,996 --> 00:20:32,250
will understand my intentions.

312
00:20:34,444 --> 00:20:37,313
You have the richest estate with tens of thousands of piculs.

313
00:20:37,540 --> 00:20:39,194
It won't affect you.

314
00:20:42,341 --> 00:20:43,578
Father,

315
00:20:44,138 --> 00:20:45,707
my estate

316
00:20:45,933 --> 00:20:48,200
is the same as Princess An Le's.

317
00:20:49,780 --> 00:20:51,017
How would

318
00:20:51,597 --> 00:20:53,692
An Le know the court's hardships?

319
00:20:54,339 --> 00:20:57,061
She can't compare to you.

320
00:21:01,427 --> 00:21:02,762
Yes, Father.

321
00:21:03,900 --> 00:21:06,074
(Looks like Father wants to use me)

322
00:21:06,252 --> 00:21:08,800
(to warn the Crown Prince and the noble families.)

323
00:21:12,755 --> 00:21:15,265
Xiao Que, don't run!

324
00:21:15,372 --> 00:21:16,609
Xiao Que.

325
00:21:17,356 --> 00:21:18,593
Xiao Que.

326
00:21:19,356 --> 00:21:20,593
Stop running.

327
00:21:21,356 --> 00:21:22,593
Xiao Que.

328
00:21:26,260 --> 00:21:28,570
- Your Highness. - Please spare me, noble one!

329
00:21:28,651 --> 00:21:30,306
Please spare me, noble one!

330
00:21:31,107 --> 00:21:32,361
What's wrong, Xiao Que?

331
00:21:34,508 --> 00:21:37,548
I said I'd teach her to read, and she ran out.

332
00:21:37,660 --> 00:21:40,580
Noble one, I don't want to learn to read.

333
00:21:40,683 --> 00:21:43,283
A Gui secretly learned a few words,

334
00:21:43,421 --> 00:21:45,838
and her master gouged out her eyes.

335
00:21:46,444 --> 00:21:47,885
You saved me.

336
00:21:48,036 --> 00:21:50,409
I'll work for you like a horse or ox.

337
00:21:50,596 --> 00:21:52,920
Don't make me study.

338
00:21:53,677 --> 00:21:54,914
Low-borns.

339
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,492
Where is your master now?

340
00:21:57,631 --> 00:22:01,026
When we were fleeing, our master died of illness.

341
00:22:01,995 --> 00:22:04,370
Grandma brought me here while escaping.

342
00:22:04,780 --> 00:22:07,034
She starved to death too.

343
00:22:07,587 --> 00:22:08,922
I see.

344
00:22:09,403 --> 00:22:10,738
According to Ye law,

345
00:22:11,012 --> 00:22:13,793
only those above commoner status can learn to read and write.

346
00:22:14,236 --> 00:22:16,300
If someone of low-born status learns to read or write,

347
00:22:16,324 --> 00:22:17,964
it's considered overstepping their place.

348
00:22:18,329 --> 00:22:20,145
No wonder you're so scared.

349
00:22:23,332 --> 00:22:24,665
From today on,

350
00:22:25,082 --> 00:22:26,657
I'll remove your low-born status.

351
00:22:27,099 --> 00:22:28,873
You can learn to read and write now.

352
00:22:29,636 --> 00:22:30,873
Really?

353
00:22:31,268 --> 00:22:32,505
Really?

354
00:22:33,596 --> 00:22:34,859
Of course.

355
00:22:35,036 --> 00:22:37,335
A princess never goes back on her word. She wouldn't lie.

356
00:22:37,867 --> 00:22:39,121
Let's head to the study.

357
00:22:39,579 --> 00:22:40,720
Thank you, noble one!

358
00:22:40,801 --> 00:22:42,374
Thank you, noble one!

359
00:22:43,516 --> 00:22:44,753
Get up.

360
00:22:46,082 --> 00:22:47,920
Let's go. Let's head to the study.

361
00:22:48,267 --> 00:22:49,599
Xiao Que, that's the wrong way.

362
00:22:49,764 --> 00:22:51,001
This way.

363
00:22:52,308 --> 00:22:54,080
Come on. This way.

364
00:22:54,722 --> 00:22:56,202
She's just like a little sparrow.

365
00:22:56,307 --> 00:22:58,267
That's why they call me Xiao Que.

366
00:22:58,358 --> 00:22:59,918
Grandma says I'm clever.

367
00:23:00,025 --> 00:23:01,963
That's why I always manage to get food.

368
00:23:02,054 --> 00:23:04,570
Otherwise, I'd have starved to death long ago.

369
00:23:04,995 --> 00:23:06,850
From now on, we won't have to fight for food.

370
00:23:08,812 --> 00:23:10,746
Are you really going to take her home?

371
00:23:16,886 --> 00:23:18,766
Nobles look down on those from humble families,

372
00:23:19,707 --> 00:23:21,602
the newly rich look down on commoners,

373
00:23:22,220 --> 00:23:24,000
and commoners look down on the low-borns.

374
00:23:24,445 --> 00:23:25,859
But the low-borns

375
00:23:26,740 --> 00:23:28,355
aren't even considered people.

376
00:23:29,469 --> 00:23:31,323
Are we really any better?

377
00:23:31,444 --> 00:23:33,378
We're just low-borns in the palace.

378
00:23:37,387 --> 00:23:38,624
Le Sheng.

379
00:23:40,133 --> 00:23:42,587
This world is rotten to the core.

380
00:23:44,556 --> 00:23:46,490
So it's time for a change.

381
00:23:51,763 --> 00:23:54,098
His Majesty ordered me to donate grains to Shen Xiao.

382
00:23:54,903 --> 00:23:57,443
They are forcing you instead of pressuring the Crown Prince.

383
00:23:57,932 --> 00:24:00,265
Isn't that making you openly oppose the Crown Prince?

384
00:24:01,891 --> 00:24:03,785
I've always been just a pawn.

385
00:24:04,220 --> 00:24:06,273
To Father and the Crown Prince, it's all the same.

386
00:24:07,956 --> 00:24:09,956
Before the Crown Prince loses His Majesty's favor,

387
00:24:10,581 --> 00:24:12,315
I have to donate these grains.

388
00:24:13,276 --> 00:24:15,409
Do you have a perfect plan?

389
00:24:16,275 --> 00:24:19,250
No. But after walking on thin ice for so long,

390
00:24:19,964 --> 00:24:22,124
I've gained some experience and learned to strategize.

391
00:24:24,541 --> 00:24:26,461
Shen Xiao has gone around to collect grains.

392
00:24:26,542 --> 00:24:28,516
It's time he came to my doorstep.

393
00:24:29,188 --> 00:24:31,642
I'll use him to make a risky move.

394
00:24:32,724 --> 00:24:34,577
It'll help me keep His Majesty's favor,

395
00:24:35,556 --> 00:24:37,530
and strike at the Eastern Palace.

396
00:24:40,052 --> 00:24:42,956
Ladies, this peony is mine now.

397
00:24:43,036 --> 00:24:45,155
- That's some big talk. - Yeah.

398
00:24:45,235 --> 00:24:46,800
The princess is here. You can't win.

399
00:24:46,931 --> 00:24:49,506
Enough with the chatter. Go ahead and pull the bow.

400
00:24:51,203 --> 00:24:53,083
- Embarrassed now, aren't you? - Exactly.

401
00:24:53,195 --> 00:24:55,200
- Let me try. - You're not even as good as me.

402
00:24:55,291 --> 00:24:56,984
I'm definitely better than you.

403
00:25:08,356 --> 00:25:09,593
Your Highness.

404
00:25:10,524 --> 00:25:11,761
Xiao Que.

405
00:25:13,426 --> 00:25:15,701
What are those nobles doing?

406
00:25:16,413 --> 00:25:18,453
They're threading flowers and testing their hearts.

407
00:25:18,501 --> 00:25:21,266
Inside that flower ball, there's a peony.

408
00:25:21,588 --> 00:25:23,802
When the peony blooms, it outshines all other flowers.

409
00:25:23,956 --> 00:25:26,150
Every other beauty bows before it.

410
00:25:27,363 --> 00:25:30,396
That peony is today's prize.

411
00:25:30,491 --> 00:25:33,823
Your Highness, what are you even saying?

412
00:25:33,947 --> 00:25:35,360
That's awesome.

413
00:25:35,441 --> 00:25:37,026
I want to be a scholar too.

414
00:25:37,154 --> 00:25:38,928
I want to be that amazing.

415
00:25:42,915 --> 00:25:44,329
(Scholars)

416
00:25:45,138 --> 00:25:47,087
(have to read tons and tons of books.)

417
00:25:47,588 --> 00:25:49,363
(The mountains and rivers on maps, )

418
00:25:49,949 --> 00:25:51,562
(the customs in travel journals, )

419
00:25:52,108 --> 00:25:53,882
(and the rise and fall in history books.)

420
00:25:55,139 --> 00:25:57,433
(I learned these things back then just to survive)

421
00:25:57,675 --> 00:25:59,595
(by becoming the Crown Prince's study companion)

422
00:25:59,675 --> 00:26:01,788
(and copying books for him.)

423
00:26:08,376 --> 00:26:11,968
Then I'll teach you to read and write myself from now on.

424
00:26:12,995 --> 00:26:14,779
Thank you, Your Highness, my benefactor.

425
00:26:14,915 --> 00:26:16,650
Good girl. Get up.

426
00:26:20,076 --> 00:26:22,729
Your Highness, Censor Shen has requested an audience.

427
00:26:24,217 --> 00:26:27,018
Censor Shen.

428
00:26:27,337 --> 00:26:29,859
Is that Censor Shen?

429
00:26:38,131 --> 00:26:39,691
Your Highness, Censor Shen has arrived.

430
00:26:39,735 --> 00:26:40,972
Oh, it's him.

431
00:26:44,139 --> 00:26:45,536
He really is handsome.

432
00:26:49,179 --> 00:26:52,244
He's the noble who saved me together with the Princess.

433
00:26:58,715 --> 00:27:01,169
Your Highness, I've brought the grain collection decree.

434
00:27:01,518 --> 00:27:03,252
I'm here to collect grain from you.

435
00:27:05,116 --> 00:27:06,880
So, it's about grain collection.

436
00:27:07,030 --> 00:27:08,326
What's going on?

437
00:27:09,740 --> 00:27:12,120
I didn't expect Censor Shen to come in person.

438
00:27:12,495 --> 00:27:14,922
- He even came to the Xianke Bordello to collect grains. - Right?

439
00:27:14,946 --> 00:27:16,359
He has come all the way here.

440
00:27:16,467 --> 00:27:18,282
It's been ages since we last met.

441
00:27:19,123 --> 00:27:20,360
And now that we finally meet,

442
00:27:21,171 --> 00:27:23,425
do you have to hit me with such a buzzkill topic?

443
00:27:30,260 --> 00:27:32,600
- Top Scholar is getting shy. - What's going on?
